OL,3,GNEWSAPreston tower block shelved for
OL,4,Aredesign
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build one of the tallest tower
OL,7,Fblocks in Lancashire have been halted
OL,8,Famid a redesign.
OL,10,FAn application to build a 23-storey
OL,11,Fapartment block in Preston city centre
OL,12,Fhas been withdrawn while developers
OL,13,Fmake the scheme "more planning
OL,14,Fcompliant", the Local Democracy
OL,15,FReporting Service reported.
OL,17,FThe blueprint for the proposed Church
OL,18,FRow development was put before Preston
OL,19,FCity Council almost 12 months ago.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
