OL,3,GNEWSAPreston tower block shelved for
OL,4,Aredesign
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 65m (213ft) block was set to have
OL,7,F120 apartments and a ground-floor
OL,8,Fretail unit, and would have become the
OL,9,Ftallest in Preston.
